snapshots/05_CANDIDATES.md:16:| `R02/RBW` | words over rectangular band `I x J`, `(i,j)(k,l)=(i,l)` | `x_i <- x_i x_(i+1)` for `i<m`, with `x_m` fixed | `|I|=|J|=2`, lengths `3..6` | exact one-sided coordinate clock; all-time image and fibre law |
